{"id":"ch-aba25622e08f","html":"<div class=\"prose\">  <span class=\"source-page\" style=\"background-color:#927164;color:inherit\"> <span class=\"source-ink\" style=\"color:#ffffff\">    <span class=\"dropcap\"><span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"dialogue\">看</span></span></span><span class=\"dialogue\">！</span><span class=\"dialogue\">那里有两颗流星诶！</span>地面上的孩子叫嚷着。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>他们带着仿佛像看电影一般的兴奋，抬头仰望着天空之屏。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>而伊藤佐一和铃木和子的身躯则划破天际，在淡长春花色的天空中，留下两道独属于狄利克雷的浅白的泪痕。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>伊藤佐一开始惊恐发作——他已经无法呼吸；他的心跳得是那么地快，以至于他连铃木和子的脸也看不清了。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"dialogue\">这就是代价！你想要吗？喏，拿去吧！</span><span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>他看着上方的猫的幻影，心中绞痛着。他想伸手触碰铃木和子的脸，可是铃木和子和他仿佛两块同极的磁铁一般，相斥着。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>天空中的云飞速地武装着自己，恫吓着伊藤佐一。 <span class=\"display-math\" data-formula=\"formula-8985ccca5646\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"bold\">Dirichlet:</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mo>∖</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∃</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msup><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi></mfrac><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>q</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n    \\textbf{Dirichlet:} \\quad \\forall \\alpha \\in \\mathbb{R} \\setminus \\mathbb{Q},\\ \\exists^\\infty \\frac{p}{q} \\in \\mathbb{Q},\\ \\left| \\alpha - \\frac{p}{q} \\right| &lt; \\frac{1}{q^2}.\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord textbf\">Dirichlet:</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∖</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.988em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">Q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∃</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">Q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:2.2019em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>是那些像神谕一般的符号——是狄利克雷逼近定理；它们把他带回到了便利店。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>伊藤佐一含泪回忆着教授的脸庞。可是他早已忘记了教授给他讲解时的神采奕奕；他也并不知道教授的去向。他开始怀念起——不，悼念起——教授，同时恳求着他的归来。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>一声声鸣叫奏响，而后转为尖锐的高音和声。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"env-center\"> <span class=\"dialogue\"> 看呵！那可寻觅的，却不可触碰的人呵！<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>下坠罢，与天地冲撞罢！<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>我们将要欢呼，有人却将要落泪；<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>可谁悲谁欢，实际无人理会。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>历史的罪人，由谁来主动扮演？<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>但早已有人雀跃着，要把那罪人赦免。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>我们将要欢呼，罪人却将要落泪；<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>可谁离谁合，放眼宇宙，无人能对！ </span> </span><span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>鸽群狂妄地歌唱着，把天空变得极为喧嚣。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>而伊藤佐一和铃木和子早已被重力带离鸽群，向雪地逼近。突然，一封信从铃木和子衣服的口袋里飘了出来；那封信迅速上升着，可是被伊藤佐一迅速抓住了。信心甘情愿地陪着他下坠。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>他在空中紧张地读了起来；手指的汗微微浸湿了信纸。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"env-quote\"> <span class=\"dialogue\"> 致伊藤佐一：<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>  我真的没想到，会在万千人海中，因为一枚奖章而与你相遇。这一切的发生过于巧合，时常让我惊讶和缓不过神。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>  你邀请我翻看你的笔记时，我从中看到的是一个执着的灵魂。实际上，看着那潦草的字迹，我心中偶尔会泛起一丝钦慕。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>  你不会想到，我鼓起勇气，决定主动对你说第一句话时，耗费了我多少心神。但我也知道——不说，可能就再无机会。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>  你与我畅聊甚欢，早已经让我惊喜万分——虽然我早就料想到，那么执着的你，心中一定有许多话要分享。隔日之后，我更没想到你会主动发起对话；那一刻的我，心中虽平静，但只是那兴奋之潮未抵达心灵的海面罢了。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>  我也一度以为，我只是你生命中的路人，你也只是一时兴起。可每周总有一两天，你要靠近我、试探我，我便意识到了什么——你是真心邀请我踏上旅程；虽然时常以冒犯我、还要让我头痛为代价。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>  可是，自从我第一次经历头痛后，我便认识到——我可能随时熬不过它。而最近头痛发作得越来越频繁了；因此有时我会想——也许我已经走到旅程的终点了。我原以为自己能陪你走得更远一些……<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>  我无法对你表示抱怨——因为是我心甘情愿陪你一起走的。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>  希望你能好好照顾自己。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>  祝好。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"env-flushright\"> 你的<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>铃木和子 </span> </span> </span><span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>伊藤佐一还没缓过神来，便早已和铃木和子划破天际，穿过密集的树枝，掉落在雪地中。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>伊藤佐一平躺在雪地里，看着信，只想直直地坐起来；可是他此时深陷雪坑和剧烈疼痛中，完全无法动弹。他侧过头，看着铃木和子没有生息的身躯，闭着眼，张着嘴，抽泣着。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>痛哭过后，一切归于寂静。伊藤佐一手里还捏着什么；但他发现，自己的手脚都在逐渐消失——他再也握不住了。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>而铃木和子，永远消失在他的视线中。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>此时的他，能看到的，只有几只小小的、急促地向远方延伸着的猫爪印。<span class=\"paragraph-break\"></span><span class=\"paragraph-indent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></span></span></div>"}